部表情特征。\n第3-4句[核心动作与台词]：连贯的动作细节(以提示词描述的动作为主)，如果有人物说话（说话内容必须从提示词描述中取，没有则为空，严格禁止自行添加），用双引号写出台词。\n第5句 [镜头运动]：摄影机如何移动，镜头视角的改变。\n第6句[高潮/结局画面]：动作的落幅，画面的最终呈现效果或声音的淡出。\n\n【提示文本】\n","","\n【输出要求】\n请直接输出一段高质量的英文提示词（如果原描述中说话内容是中文，则说话内容为中文。不需要分条，只需一整个自然段）",""]},{"id":37,"type":"ReservedVRAMSetter","pos":[-470.26875051778364,-26.61255994320706],"size":[224.0357421875,218],"flags":{"collapsed":true},"order":14,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"anything","name":"anything","shape":7,"type":"*","link":48},{"localized_name":"reserved","name":"reserved","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"reserved"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"mode","name":"mode","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"mode"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"seed","name":"seed","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"seed"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"auto_max_reserved","name":"auto_max_reserved","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"auto_max_reserved"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"clean_gpu_before","name":"clean_gpu_before","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"clean_gpu_before"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"output","name":"output","type":"*","links":[47]},{"localized_name":"SEED","name":"SEED","type":"INT","links":null},{"localized_name":"Reserved(GB)","name":"Reserved(GB)","type":"FLOAT","links":null}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"reservedvram","ver":"1.0.0","Node name for S&R":"ReservedVRAMSetter"},"widgets_values":[0.6,"auto",663446978190941,"randomize",0,true]},{"id":40,"type":"ManualSigmas","pos":[-1771.77252829533,917.1644068101473],"size":[586.5635222029367,58],"flags":{},"order":6,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"label":"sigmas","localized_name":"sigmas","name":"sigmas","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"sigmas"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"label":"SIGMAS","localized_name":"SIGMAS","name":"SIGMAS","type":"SIGMAS","links":[14]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.5.1","Node name for S&R":"ManualSigmas","hasSecondTab":false,"widget_ue_connectable":{},"secondTabText":"Send Back","enableTabs":false,"secondTabOffset":80,"